	(descr "QFN-24 4x4 mm 0.5 mm pitch, hand-solder variant: pads extended 0.6 mm outward for drag soldering, exposed pad as a 1.5 mm plated hole to fill from the back. Flux, drag the pad ends, then solder the exposed pad through the hole. (The source's four paste-only apertures over the exposed pad are kept; there is no stencil in a hand build.)")
